Q('Medium', 'Round Up Division', 'Print how many buses of capacity C are needed for N students. | Input: N then C. | Output: the buses.', lambda s: -(-iv(s)[0] // iv(s)[1]), [L(50, 12)], lambda r: L(r.randint(1, 300), r.randint(1, 40)))
