Q('Hard', 'Mixed Expression', 'Print the value of (A + B) * C - A // B + C % B. | Input: A, B, C on three lines. | Output: the value.', lambda s: (lambda a, b, c: (a + b) * c - a // b + c % b)(*iv(s)), [L(7, 2, 5)], lambda r: L(r.randint(1, 30), r.randint(1, 9), r.randint(1, 30)))
